    "result_json": "data/stage26_variable_budget_consensus_qubo_result.json",
    "report_md": "reports/stage-26/variable_budget_consensus_qubo.md"
  },
  "interpretation_boundary": "A pass can establish only that a frozen label-independent non-submodular QUBO is sampled stably and outperforms the recorded same-objective classical heuristics on the tested structural instances. It cannot establish docking enrichment, biological benefit, quantum speedup, quantum advantage, or hardware readiness. Only a pass authorizes a separately preregistered functional-complementarity experiment."
